WEBVTT

01:37.500 --> 01:42.950
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.460 --> 01:45.950
[Episode 16]

01:46.229 --> 01:47.470
I am more anxious.

01:48.150 --> 01:51.000
I wish I could rewrite the past.

01:51.350 --> 01:53.280
But the dead are gone,

01:54.950 --> 01:56.640
and nothing can be changed.

01:58.470 --> 02:01.680
I'm just a bit surprised why Lord Yan

02:01.950 --> 02:04.070
seems more anxious than I am.

02:04.680 --> 02:07.870
It's as if you wanted me to believe it
immediately upon hearing,

02:07.870 --> 02:10.470
and punish the murderer right after.

02:10.870 --> 02:11.470
Isn't this

02:11.840 --> 02:13.590
a bit hasty?

02:14.150 --> 02:15.800
But this also reminds me...

02:17.750 --> 02:20.070
Does the sudden appearance
of this maidservant

02:20.070 --> 02:23.800
involve any conspiracy behind the scenes?

02:24.190 --> 02:25.920
What exactly is the intention?

02:26.400 --> 02:27.190
Lord Yan,

02:27.840 --> 02:29.870
if in my private residence,

02:30.430 --> 02:32.120
I listen to a one-sided story,

02:32.470 --> 02:34.240
set up a private court,

02:34.870 --> 02:38.280
and catch the so-called murderer,

02:38.710 --> 02:43.750
wouldn't that be the greatest contempt
for the law and justice?

02:44.240 --> 02:48.070
Wouldn't that be
the greatest perversion of the law?

02:58.960 --> 03:00.150
Lord Yan.

03:05.910 --> 03:06.840
Lord Yan,

03:07.430 --> 03:10.800
you want to redress the injustice
for Qingyuan's birth mother.

03:10.800 --> 03:13.260
Your sincerity
is clear to heaven and earth.

03:13.560 --> 03:14.820
Since that is the case,

03:15.400 --> 03:17.660
we will certainly help you achieve this.

03:18.360 --> 03:19.430
From tomorrow,

03:19.750 --> 03:23.210
the Xie Residence will clarify
the rumors about Fourth Madam,

03:23.520 --> 03:26.560
and never let her suffer
any grievance again.

03:27.240 --> 03:30.800
However, the matter concerning
Qingyuan's birth mother

03:31.190 --> 03:33.310
happened many years ago.

03:33.560 --> 03:35.910
It wouldn’t be appropriate
to make a big deal out of it.

03:35.910 --> 03:37.910
As for the real murderer back then,

03:38.150 --> 03:41.310
we will certainly
investigate it to the end.

03:41.800 --> 03:43.030
I hope Lord Yan

03:43.680 --> 03:45.190
can give us a few more days.

03:45.800 --> 03:46.800
Is that possible?

03:53.310 --> 03:54.070
Alright.

03:55.360 --> 03:56.910
I believe Old Madam Xie

03:58.190 --> 03:59.360
will do as she says.

04:05.260 --> 04:06.570
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

04:08.080 --> 04:08.940
Your Lordship.

04:13.240 --> 04:15.400
Mei Yinghua pushed all the blame

04:15.680 --> 04:16.950
onto Chuntai.

04:17.120 --> 04:18.800
Even with Cui'er as a witness,

04:19.269 --> 04:20.950
as long as she refuses to admit it,

04:20.950 --> 04:23.000
I won't be able to convict her
before the Master

04:23.000 --> 04:24.000
and Grandmother.

04:27.360 --> 04:28.920
The path you chose for yourself is one

04:28.920 --> 04:31.270
you should walk down
with undivided resolve.

04:31.270 --> 04:32.600
If there's any problem,

04:32.720 --> 04:34.320
I will always have your back.

04:34.510 --> 04:35.480
No matter when,

04:36.150 --> 04:37.120
no matter what.

04:43.040 --> 04:45.700
Ancestors of the Xie family,
please protect me.

04:47.430 --> 04:48.270
Protect me.

04:49.000 --> 04:49.830
Protect me.

04:50.600 --> 04:51.430
Protect us,

04:52.480 --> 04:53.310
ancestors.

04:58.830 --> 05:04.070
[Harmony Among Kin]

05:11.000 --> 05:11.830
Second Madam.

05:12.750 --> 05:14.430
The Bodhisattva will not protect

05:14.430 --> 05:16.290
those with guilt in their hearts.

05:19.240 --> 05:20.570
What are you doing here?

05:20.680 --> 05:21.870
I came to ask,

05:22.950 --> 05:24.390
since you keep saying

05:24.390 --> 05:26.250
you never harmed my birth mother,

05:26.630 --> 05:29.240
can you swear to it
in front of the ancestors?

05:27.100 --> 05:29.410
[Spirit Tablet of the Late Ancestors
of the Xie Family]

05:32.120 --> 05:33.580
Why should I listen to you?

05:33.950 --> 05:35.630
Because Yan Rui listens to me.

05:36.390 --> 05:38.650
Second Madam, you should know very well.

05:38.920 --> 05:42.040
If Lord Yan insists on
putting you in prison,

05:42.310 --> 05:44.120
neither Father nor Grandmother

05:44.360 --> 05:45.920
would hesitate to hand you over

05:45.920 --> 05:47.450
for the Xie family's peace.

05:51.680 --> 05:53.270
Do I look like I'm afraid of you?

05:53.270 --> 05:55.470
Our Mei family also holds a noble title.

05:55.950 --> 05:57.000
So what?

05:57.360 --> 05:59.960
Even Father has to stay on
Lord Yan's good side.

06:00.270 --> 06:02.600
Can the mere Mei family save you?

06:05.680 --> 06:07.080
No, let me put it this way.

06:08.630 --> 06:10.560
Is a concubine's married daughter

06:11.920 --> 06:13.920
worth being saved by the Mei family?

06:16.310 --> 06:17.240
What do you want?

06:17.430 --> 06:19.230
I want to hear you tell the truth.

06:19.800 --> 06:21.240
If you swear to God

06:21.240 --> 06:22.830
that you've never harmed my mother,

06:22.830 --> 06:25.300
I will immediately
have Yan Rui close this case.

06:25.300 --> 06:26.240
But,

06:30.860 --> 06:32.180
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

06:37.190 --> 06:38.600
if you break your vow,

06:39.310 --> 06:40.909
your son, your pride and joy,

06:41.240 --> 06:42.720
will be struck by lightning

06:42.720 --> 06:44.120
and die a horrible death!

06:44.150 --> 06:45.240
You just want me to swear.

06:45.240 --> 06:46.840
Why involve my son Zhenglun?

06:47.480 --> 06:48.150
What?

06:48.510 --> 06:50.170
Are you afraid, Second Madam?

06:54.000 --> 06:54.750
That's fine.

06:54.870 --> 06:55.920
I'll go tell Yan Rui right now...

06:54.900 --> 06:56.140
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

07:08.570 --> 07:10.870
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

07:16.310 --> 07:17.680
I, Mei Yinghua, swear,

07:18.240 --> 07:20.840
I'd never harmed
Fourth Madam and Fifth Madam.

07:21.240 --> 07:22.710
If I'm lying,

07:22.920 --> 07:24.480
may my son Zhenglun be struck by lightning

07:24.480 --> 07:25.880
and die a horrible death!

07:30.850 --> 07:31.940
[Spirit Tablet of the Late Ancestors
of the Xie Family]

07:34.600 --> 07:35.510
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

07:39.770 --> 07:42.090
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

07:40.150 --> 07:41.830
Zhenglun! Zhenglun!

07:42.240 --> 07:43.000
Zhenglun!

07:43.000 --> 07:44.430
Zhenglun, wake up!

07:44.800 --> 07:45.860
Zhenglun, wake up!

07:46.070 --> 07:46.830
A doctor.

07:47.040 --> 07:48.190
Get a doctor quickly!

07:48.190 --> 07:49.600
Why are you just standing there?

07:48.560 --> 07:49.970
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

07:50.040 --> 07:50.870
Zhenglun!

07:52.000 --> 07:52.750
Zhenglun!

07:53.870 --> 07:54.720
Zhenglun...

07:57.000 --> 07:58.510
This is karma.

07:59.150 --> 08:00.150
He can't be saved.

08:00.720 --> 08:02.850
Who was it that just swore a deadly vow?

08:03.720 --> 08:04.390
Zhenglun!

08:05.070 --> 08:05.800
Zhenglun!

08:09.000 --> 08:11.800
Oh, God...

08:11.900 --> 08:20.260
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

08:12.560 --> 08:15.510
It's all my fault.

08:16.950 --> 08:18.360
Zhenglun!

08:20.390 --> 08:21.560
I did it.

08:21.870 --> 08:23.000
I did it all.

08:24.120 --> 08:25.480
Please save my child.

08:26.390 --> 08:28.390
Get a doctor to save my child.

08:35.150 --> 08:36.080
I think

08:37.150 --> 08:38.390
we need to give her

08:38.750 --> 08:40.270
irrefutable proof.

08:42.750 --> 08:44.690
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

08:45.200 --> 08:46.000
Qingyuan.

08:48.670 --> 08:49.800
You wanted to see me?

09:14.200 --> 09:14.720
Mother.

09:15.870 --> 09:18.790
Qingyuan said you were guilty,
but I didn't believe it.

09:18.790 --> 09:20.320
I wanted to clear your name.

09:22.120 --> 09:22.870
But why?

09:24.000 --> 09:26.000
Why did you do such a vicious thing?

09:27.670 --> 09:28.600
Son.

09:34.630 --> 09:35.230
Qingyuan.

09:35.750 --> 09:36.870
We have wronged you

09:37.150 --> 09:38.150
and Fourth Madam.

09:40.080 --> 09:41.080
You bitch!

09:40.910 --> 09:42.300
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

09:41.080 --> 09:42.390
How dare you set me up!

09:42.390 --> 09:43.200
Mother.

09:44.200 --> 09:44.870
Mother.

09:45.030 --> 09:46.760
We can't keep making mistakes.

09:51.600 --> 09:52.200
Father.

09:52.390 --> 09:53.440
My mother has acknowledged her mistake.

09:53.440 --> 09:54.870
Since things have come to this,

09:54.870 --> 09:56.400
I will no longer defend her.

09:56.630 --> 10:00.160
I only ask that she spend
the rest of her life with the Xie family.

10:01.790 --> 10:02.440
Father.

10:04.670 --> 10:05.320
Father.

10:07.480 --> 10:08.080
Zhenglun,

10:09.120 --> 10:10.250
you may leave first.

10:10.750 --> 10:11.680
Grandmother...

10:12.480 --> 10:13.210
Be a good boy.

10:14.960 --> 10:16.290
Go change your clothes.

10:37.120 --> 10:37.910
Zhenglun.

10:50.500 --> 10:56.550
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

10:51.790 --> 10:52.750
Mei Yinghua,

10:55.440 --> 10:56.870
you framed my mother

10:56.580 --> 11:02.620
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

10:58.720 --> 11:00.720
and made her bear a disgraceful name

11:01.200 --> 11:02.720
so she'd leave the residence voluntarily.

11:02.720 --> 11:08.010
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

11:04.670 --> 11:06.720
You even wanted to drive us

11:07.440 --> 11:08.790
both to our deaths.

11:08.070 --> 11:14.130
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

11:11.960 --> 11:13.120
You really should

11:14.030 --> 11:15.790
pay for my mother's life!

11:14.200 --> 11:20.390
♪ Pear blossoms drift through the courtyard,
fluttering like snowflakes in a song ♪

11:18.480 --> 11:20.000
That's an accusation.

11:20.360 --> 11:22.030
After Jin Chunqing left the Xie Residence,

11:20.420 --> 11:26.680
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

11:22.030 --> 11:24.000
I had no idea where she went.

11:24.000 --> 11:26.320
How can you pin this on me?

11:26.780 --> 11:33.070
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

11:33.090 --> 11:38.990
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

11:33.200 --> 11:34.600
Whether you did it or not,

11:35.360 --> 11:36.890
you know best in your heart.

11:39.010 --> 11:45.180
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

11:45.200 --> 11:51.300
♪ I wonder, is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

11:45.510 --> 11:46.440
Qingyuan,

11:47.270 --> 11:50.360
are you sure Concubine Mei killed her?

11:51.320 --> 11:57.540
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
of life and death ♪

11:57.510 --> 11:58.270
Yes,

11:57.560 --> 12:03.240
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

11:59.120 --> 11:59.870
I'm sure.

12:03.200 --> 12:04.480
9 years ago,

12:05.550 --> 12:07.750
she started a fire at my house.

12:12.150 --> 12:12.910
My mother

12:14.200 --> 12:16.150
died in that fire.

12:17.150 --> 12:19.200
Nonsense. I didn't kill anyone!

12:19.200 --> 12:19.840
Master!

12:22.750 --> 12:23.840
I believe

12:24.200 --> 12:26.860
Fourth Lady and Cui'er
are telling the truth.

12:27.030 --> 12:28.240
You and Fourth Madam

12:28.600 --> 12:30.000
were once deeply in love.

12:30.030 --> 12:31.000
At this point,

12:31.510 --> 12:32.790
do you still have the heart

12:32.790 --> 12:34.520
to let her die with a grievance?

12:37.600 --> 12:39.120
Please look into this, Master.

12:39.120 --> 12:39.840
You bitch!

12:39.840 --> 12:40.770
Mother! Mother!

12:40.770 --> 12:42.120
-How dare you frame me!
-Mother! Mother!

12:42.120 --> 12:44.000
-Mother! Mother!
-Enough!

12:59.140 --> 13:01.490
[Harmony Among Kin]

13:02.080 --> 13:03.120
I admit,

13:07.840 --> 13:11.000
I resented Fifth Madam
for being so favored

13:12.120 --> 13:13.870
and overbearing.

13:14.960 --> 13:16.840
So I poisoned her!

13:23.510 --> 13:26.150
But I only gave her abortion pills.

13:26.720 --> 13:28.510
I didn't want her dead!

13:29.150 --> 13:31.120
I framed Fourth Madam

13:31.910 --> 13:33.630
because I just wanted to drive her
out of the residence.

13:33.630 --> 13:35.240
I really didn't kill anyone.

13:35.240 --> 13:37.700
I don't know what happened later.

13:37.910 --> 13:39.720
All this talk about murder and arson

13:39.720 --> 13:41.390
is pure nonsense!

13:39.810 --> 13:41.350
[Harmony Among Kin]

13:41.390 --> 13:42.390
Concubine Mei.

13:44.790 --> 13:46.750
I only care about one thing.

13:47.080 --> 13:50.120
You finally admitted it.

13:50.960 --> 13:52.320
You poisoned her

13:55.870 --> 13:57.360
with your own hands,

14:00.790 --> 14:01.480
didn't you?

14:19.360 --> 14:20.150
Master,

14:21.120 --> 14:22.960
please believe me.

14:23.750 --> 14:25.600
I didn't kill anyone.

14:29.550 --> 14:30.360
Father.

14:31.670 --> 14:32.390
Father.

14:32.600 --> 14:34.360
It's been over a decade.

14:34.910 --> 14:36.620
Even if you kill my mother now,

14:36.650 --> 14:38.600
Fourth Madam and Fifth Madam
won't come back to life.

14:38.600 --> 14:39.150
Father,

14:39.440 --> 14:40.770
please spare my mother.

14:46.670 --> 14:48.480
Listen to me, everyone.

14:50.630 --> 14:52.080
From today on,

14:52.480 --> 14:58.290
[Harmony Among Kin]

14:56.480 --> 14:58.030
Zhengjun

15:00.150 --> 15:01.840
is no longer your mother.

15:07.030 --> 15:07.960
Father!

15:08.480 --> 15:09.030
Father!

15:12.120 --> 15:12.920
Grandmother.

15:13.080 --> 15:13.880
Grandmother.

15:13.910 --> 15:15.000
I beg of you.

15:15.000 --> 15:16.750
Please help me persuade my father.

15:16.750 --> 15:17.480
Okay?

15:17.840 --> 15:19.550
I will take responsibility
for Mother's crimes.

15:19.550 --> 15:21.270
I will accept any beating or punishment.

15:21.270 --> 15:22.600
I beg you, Grandmother.

15:29.030 --> 15:31.480
Second Madam is your concubine.

15:32.240 --> 15:33.720
You make the decision.

15:53.120 --> 15:55.380
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

16:12.240 --> 16:14.100
Fifty Strokes of the Family Cane.

16:18.320 --> 16:20.250
Whether she survives is up to fate.

16:29.960 --> 16:30.600
Qingyuan

16:31.030 --> 16:32.270
pays her respects to Grandmother

16:32.270 --> 16:32.930
and Mother.

16:34.320 --> 16:35.120
How is it?

16:36.320 --> 16:38.150
How are things

16:38.150 --> 16:39.610
over at Liuhua Courtyard?

16:39.630 --> 16:40.890
To answer you, Mother,

16:41.320 --> 16:43.240
Second Madam is still breathing.

16:43.550 --> 16:44.910
Second Young Master pulled some strings.

16:44.910 --> 16:46.570
They didn't beat her to death.

16:48.510 --> 16:50.360
Amitabha.

16:51.000 --> 16:52.360
Even so,

16:52.790 --> 16:53.870
have the servants

16:54.030 --> 16:55.960
send her back to Liuhua Courtyard first.

16:55.960 --> 16:57.960
Pick an inconspicuous day later

16:58.440 --> 17:00.510
and send her away to the farmstead.

17:07.240 --> 17:08.349
This time,

17:09.000 --> 17:11.800
the Xie Residence
really owes you and your mother.

17:12.200 --> 17:13.640
After some time,

17:14.240 --> 17:17.160
we'll invite your mother's spirit tablet
into the Xie Residence

17:17.160 --> 17:19.290
and enshrine it in the ancestral hall.

17:23.240 --> 17:24.839
I appreciate your kindness,

17:24.960 --> 17:26.240
Grandmother.

17:26.920 --> 17:29.110
But my mother was wrongly accused.

17:29.400 --> 17:32.510
It might be inappropriate
to enshrine her in the ancestral hall now.

17:32.510 --> 17:35.480
Danyue Pavilion
is my mother's former residence.

17:36.000 --> 17:37.510
I'm used to living there too.

17:37.510 --> 17:40.070
I hope you will allow me

17:40.240 --> 17:43.100
to enshrine my mother's tablet
in Danyue Pavilion.

17:43.240 --> 17:46.370
It will be convenient for me
to pay respects frequently.

17:47.310 --> 17:48.270
Fine.

17:49.200 --> 17:50.590
As you wish.

17:53.200 --> 17:54.600
Thank you, Grandmother.

17:56.550 --> 17:57.750
I know that

17:58.440 --> 17:59.840
recently, the residence

18:00.510 --> 18:02.440
has had much trouble because of me.

18:02.590 --> 18:04.070
But as my mother's child,

18:04.680 --> 18:06.400
how could I just sit back and watch

18:06.400 --> 18:08.200
when my mother was wronged?

18:08.640 --> 18:10.440
As for those who committed evil,

18:10.960 --> 18:11.830
I

18:12.200 --> 18:14.160
will definitely not let them off easily.

18:14.160 --> 18:16.000
But I understand clearly,

18:16.270 --> 18:17.600
and I'm deeply grateful

18:17.750 --> 18:18.790
for the tolerance

18:19.160 --> 18:20.270
that you and Mother

18:20.920 --> 18:23.310
have shown me.

18:25.750 --> 18:30.030
Since you have achieved
your goal this time,

18:30.590 --> 18:31.960
in the days to come,

18:32.830 --> 18:35.270
I hope you can live peacefully

18:36.510 --> 18:38.240
and not cause any more trouble.

18:40.640 --> 18:41.640
Qingyuan,

18:43.550 --> 18:45.310
the herbal shop business

18:45.920 --> 18:47.520
will still be managed by you.

18:48.510 --> 18:50.070
Just as the Old Madam said,

18:51.200 --> 18:52.730
your birth mother's matter

18:52.960 --> 18:54.690
has been settled as you wished.

18:54.750 --> 18:57.240
Cultivate your character in the future

18:57.920 --> 18:59.580
and treat others generously.

19:00.160 --> 19:01.020
Remember that.

19:02.550 --> 19:04.590
I will keep your teachings in mind.

19:18.960 --> 19:19.590
Mother.

19:20.640 --> 19:22.920
Mei Yinghua has confessed her crimes.

19:23.590 --> 19:24.880
From now on,

19:26.240 --> 19:27.310
no one in this world

19:27.570 --> 19:30.240
[Memorial Tablet of Lady Jin,
Concubine of Lord Xie]

19:27.830 --> 19:30.090
will call you a murderous villain again.

19:30.640 --> 19:31.750
No one

19:32.830 --> 19:34.610
will ever hurt you like this again.

19:34.610 --> 19:36.720
[Memorial Tablet of Lady Jin,
Concubine of Lord Xie]

19:57.960 --> 19:58.680
Father.

19:59.440 --> 20:00.510
Qingyuan.

20:02.720 --> 20:06.400
I am deeply ashamed of making you

20:07.750 --> 20:10.880
and your mother suffer this injustice
for so many years.

20:15.030 --> 20:16.160
It's all in the past.

20:17.310 --> 20:18.480
In the past,

20:19.790 --> 20:20.920
you were kept

20:21.750 --> 20:23.280
in the dark by Second Madam.

20:42.650 --> 20:44.840
[Memorial Tablet of Lady Jin,
Concubine of Lord Xie]

20:51.790 --> 20:52.680
Chunqing.

21:05.030 --> 21:05.880
Mother,

21:07.880 --> 21:09.200
are you seeing this?

21:12.640 --> 21:14.040
Father is here to see you.

21:17.870 --> 21:21.390
[Danyue Pavilion]

21:18.240 --> 21:20.960
Seeing Zhenglun today

21:21.960 --> 21:24.070
reminds me of my younger self.

21:24.830 --> 21:26.880
He was passionate and impulsive.

21:28.720 --> 21:30.110
When I was young,

21:31.000 --> 21:33.400
I wanted to pierce the sky.

21:36.830 --> 21:37.920
But eventually,

21:39.400 --> 21:42.790
I had to submit to my family name,
my clan,

21:43.720 --> 21:45.200
rules, and etiquette.

21:47.550 --> 21:48.590
Qingyuan.

21:49.680 --> 21:50.720
Concubine Mei

21:50.790 --> 21:53.790
has paid the price for her actions.

21:55.110 --> 21:57.000
Let it all be in the past.

21:57.680 --> 21:59.030
From now on,

21:59.640 --> 22:01.100
our family will live well.

22:02.240 --> 22:04.880
I must make up for what I owe you.

22:07.110 --> 22:08.070
Father.

22:09.880 --> 22:11.410
Have you ever occasionally

22:11.590 --> 22:13.120
thought of my birth mother?

22:16.680 --> 22:17.440
Of course.

22:22.510 --> 22:24.910
Not a day goes by without me
thinking of her.

22:29.400 --> 22:32.330
Mother is from
a well-matched, prestigious family.

22:32.750 --> 22:33.880
Marrying her

22:34.790 --> 22:36.590
helped you advance in the court.

22:36.960 --> 22:39.160
Second Madam is from a merchant family,

22:39.350 --> 22:41.030
which can help

22:42.030 --> 22:43.560
the Xie family's business.

22:44.030 --> 22:46.160
Third Madam is from a scholarly family,

22:46.160 --> 22:47.510
which can elevate

22:48.030 --> 22:49.960
your reputation

22:50.200 --> 22:51.440
among scholars.

22:52.480 --> 22:54.610
My birth mother was of humble origins.

22:56.880 --> 22:58.810
She had no prestigious background

22:59.270 --> 23:01.130
and couldn't help the Xie family.

23:01.590 --> 23:03.070
So why do you say that

23:03.750 --> 23:05.270
she was the only wife

23:05.960 --> 23:07.270
in your heart?

23:10.110 --> 23:11.370
You don't understand.

23:20.230 --> 23:22.850
[Danyue Pavilion]

23:27.030 --> 23:28.480
Everything I do

23:28.480 --> 23:29.960
is for this family.

23:33.400 --> 23:34.270
Qingyuan.

23:35.590 --> 23:36.790
You are still young.

23:37.160 --> 23:39.200
When you reach my age,

23:39.200 --> 23:40.880
perhaps you will understand.

23:41.400 --> 23:43.960
Many things in life

23:43.960 --> 23:45.310
are hard to balance.

23:45.830 --> 23:48.480
I had to be the pillar of the Xie family

23:50.640 --> 23:52.750
while not failing the woman I love.

23:54.440 --> 23:55.590
It was hard.

23:56.720 --> 23:59.070
To be the pillar of the Xie family,

23:59.590 --> 24:02.440
everything must be
for the sake of the family.

24:03.200 --> 24:06.830
The firmer the foundation, the better.

24:07.200 --> 24:09.640
The taller the tower, the better.

24:10.200 --> 24:15.960
Even if it means sacrificing my own love

24:16.790 --> 24:19.110
or even my life.

24:21.240 --> 24:23.590
How can I care about anything else?

24:25.110 --> 24:26.510
As for myself,

24:27.480 --> 24:29.750
when have I ever had my own life?

24:31.680 --> 24:33.270
Chunqing has passed away.

24:34.830 --> 24:36.760
True love will never come by again.

24:38.510 --> 24:40.510
I have failed your birth mother,

24:42.270 --> 24:45.590
and I fear I can never make it up to her.

24:56.830 --> 24:57.880
Qingyuan.

24:59.750 --> 25:01.830
If your birth mother knew about this,

25:02.550 --> 25:03.400
now,

25:04.310 --> 25:05.830
she would only want one thing,

25:05.830 --> 25:07.430
and that is for you to be well.

25:09.200 --> 25:10.260
Do you understand?

25:20.510 --> 25:21.400
Father.

25:22.350 --> 25:23.480
I understand.

25:24.000 --> 25:25.160
From now on,

25:26.270 --> 25:28.030
I will be a good daughter

25:28.130 --> 25:31.280
[Danyue Pavilion]

25:28.350 --> 25:31.310
and won't make you suffer
and feel guilty anymore.

25:31.440 --> 25:32.700
You don't understand!

25:33.400 --> 25:35.070
I don't want you to do those.

25:36.030 --> 25:37.240
I only hope

25:37.590 --> 25:38.960
you do one thing.

25:39.440 --> 25:41.000
That is, from now on,

25:42.030 --> 25:43.400
be safe, healthy,

25:45.110 --> 25:46.200
and carefree.

25:53.030 --> 25:54.350
Rest early.

26:07.000 --> 26:09.800
You value the reputation
of the Xie family so much.

26:10.110 --> 26:11.310
For this reputation,

26:11.880 --> 26:14.880
you didn't hesitate to kill
my mother with your own hands.

26:14.880 --> 26:16.680
Then I must topple this mountain

26:16.920 --> 26:18.750
you built with your own hands

26:19.790 --> 26:21.270
right in front of you.

26:35.440 --> 26:36.240
What's wrong?

26:36.680 --> 26:37.790
Aren't you happy

26:38.310 --> 26:39.110
that I'm back?

26:41.830 --> 26:43.090
Wei Changyan escaped.

26:44.830 --> 26:46.640
I searched for hundreds of miles,

26:46.640 --> 26:48.240
but still couldn't find him.

26:50.680 --> 26:52.610
You don't need to worry about this.

26:52.680 --> 26:54.340
Everything is under control.

26:54.590 --> 26:55.790
The bait we threw out

26:56.640 --> 26:58.440
might catch an even bigger fish.

26:58.880 --> 27:00.440
I don't want any big fish!

27:01.310 --> 27:03.000
I want Wei Changyan dead.

27:03.510 --> 27:04.510
I want him to pay with his life

27:04.510 --> 27:06.510
for the 72 deaths of our Shen family!

27:18.590 --> 27:19.830
I promise you.

27:20.830 --> 27:21.790
Wei Changyan

27:24.070 --> 27:25.590
will only die by my hands.

27:27.200 --> 27:29.800
And I won't let the people
behind him and Xie Shu

27:30.640 --> 27:31.790
off either.

27:51.310 --> 27:52.350
Zhenglun.

27:55.400 --> 27:58.000
Although your birth mother
made a big mistake,

27:58.640 --> 27:59.880
I know

28:00.480 --> 28:02.030
you are a good child.

28:04.960 --> 28:07.290
When you return to the Northern Frontier,

28:07.350 --> 28:08.880
take good care of yourself.

28:09.480 --> 28:10.440
Don't forget

28:11.350 --> 28:12.960
to write home often.

28:17.160 --> 28:17.960
Okay.

28:19.030 --> 28:19.830
Grandmother.

28:20.750 --> 28:22.210
Take care of yourself too.

28:25.400 --> 28:26.310
Zhenglun.

28:28.590 --> 28:30.750
Don't worry about things at home.

28:31.550 --> 28:32.640
Do your job well.

28:35.790 --> 28:36.440
Yes.

28:37.960 --> 28:38.590
Mother.

28:45.720 --> 28:48.830
[Guohuai Inn]

28:49.790 --> 28:50.520
I'm leaving.

28:52.110 --> 28:54.170
The family depends on you from now on.

28:57.030 --> 28:58.830
Take on your responsibilities.

28:59.590 --> 29:00.790
Don't act like a child

29:01.440 --> 29:02.840
and waste your life away.

29:16.440 --> 29:18.320
[Guohuai Inn]

29:18.680 --> 29:19.400
Brother!

29:19.750 --> 29:20.590
Take care!

29:24.750 --> 29:25.830
Go back.

29:33.200 --> 29:34.160
Brother!

29:37.000 --> 29:38.310
Take care!

29:42.490 --> 29:48.280
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

29:48.370 --> 29:54.090
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

29:49.620 --> 29:53.570
[Guohuai Inn]

29:54.510 --> 29:59.860
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

29:59.950 --> 30:05.880
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

30:06.260 --> 30:12.120
♪ Pear blossoms drift through the courtyard,
fluttering like snowflakes in a song ♪

30:12.280 --> 30:18.420
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

30:18.490 --> 30:24.850
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

30:24.870 --> 30:30.910
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

30:30.940 --> 30:36.880
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

30:36.900 --> 30:43.120
♪ I wonder, is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

30:39.750 --> 30:41.210
Even now, I still remember

30:42.510 --> 30:44.830
how Mother sewed winter clothes
for us back then.

30:43.150 --> 30:49.390
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
of life and death ♪

30:46.070 --> 30:47.870
Although she was hot-tempered,

30:47.880 --> 30:49.160
to Zhengjun and me,

30:49.410 --> 30:55.290
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

30:49.720 --> 30:51.270
she always gave her all.

30:54.440 --> 30:55.480
I don't know

30:56.590 --> 30:58.310
why she became like this.

31:00.070 --> 31:01.000
Eldest Brother.

31:02.000 --> 31:03.680
A person's faults do not
extend to their children.

31:03.680 --> 31:06.270
Mei Yinghua's actions
have nothing to do with you.

31:06.270 --> 31:07.480
I won't blame you.

31:16.590 --> 31:17.510
Tomorrow,

31:18.400 --> 31:20.130
I will head to the battlefield.

31:21.960 --> 31:22.960
If this life

31:24.110 --> 31:25.830
can atone for half of her sins,

31:26.310 --> 31:28.270
it will be enough to repay our bond.

31:29.070 --> 31:29.790
I also hope

31:31.200 --> 31:32.550
it can lessen some of the

31:32.790 --> 31:33.990
hatred in your heart.

31:36.480 --> 31:37.740
Don't speak nonsense.

31:38.680 --> 31:39.920
You will surely

31:40.000 --> 31:41.400
protect the nation, achieve great things,

31:41.400 --> 31:42.660
and return in triumph.

31:53.680 --> 31:54.280
Qingyuan.

31:54.640 --> 31:56.550
These are freshly dried persimmons
from the Northern Frontier.

31:56.550 --> 31:58.410
They are soft, sticky, and sweet.

31:59.110 --> 32:00.570
I picked among three types

32:00.590 --> 32:02.400
and chose the sweetest one.

32:02.640 --> 32:03.440
Try it.

32:04.350 --> 32:05.400
If you like it,

32:05.830 --> 32:07.590
I'll dry a whole rack of them
when I return,

32:07.590 --> 32:08.680
just for us to eat.

32:10.680 --> 32:12.210
Thank you, Eldest Brother.

32:15.590 --> 32:16.990
I consider you my sister.

32:17.550 --> 32:18.810
Naturally, I hope that

32:19.510 --> 32:21.920
you can move on from your hatred soon.

32:26.110 --> 32:27.640
At your blooming age,

32:32.830 --> 32:34.200
you should smile more.

32:51.480 --> 32:52.510
Eldest Brother,

32:54.830 --> 32:56.430
I hope you return in triumph.

33:14.240 --> 33:15.040
Your Majesty.

33:15.510 --> 33:17.750
This ginseng is well-aged.

33:18.160 --> 33:19.890
I have tested the temperature,

33:20.200 --> 33:21.600
it's just right to drink.

33:21.790 --> 33:23.830
Eunuch Xia, you are indeed used to

33:23.830 --> 33:25.270
serving the late Emperor.

33:25.270 --> 33:26.960
The late Emperor loved this soup,

33:26.960 --> 33:27.920
but I do not.

33:28.830 --> 33:32.270
The late Emperor relied on this soup
for longevity.

33:32.830 --> 33:33.680
But now,

33:34.310 --> 33:35.790
Your Majesty is in your prime,

33:35.790 --> 33:37.720
which is a blessing for the nation.

33:37.830 --> 33:40.030
We old servants

33:40.200 --> 33:42.750
all wish you good health.

33:46.640 --> 33:48.790
Is there any news outside recently?

33:49.110 --> 33:51.510
I wouldn't call it news,

33:51.750 --> 33:53.510
but over in Hengtang,

33:53.750 --> 33:55.720
public resentment is boiling over.

33:55.720 --> 33:57.880
It's getting out of hand.

33:58.440 --> 33:59.880
It's strange,

34:00.160 --> 34:02.880
the honest censors usually

34:03.440 --> 34:05.240
love to petition for the people.

34:05.550 --> 34:07.310
But now, over in Hengtang,

34:07.750 --> 34:08.880
they have

34:09.590 --> 34:10.630
gone silent.

34:13.360 --> 34:15.420
Since public resentment is boiling,

34:15.440 --> 34:17.040
let Shen Run come back first.

34:34.020 --> 34:40.989
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

34:41.020 --> 34:47.639
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

34:47.739 --> 34:55.380
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

34:55.500 --> 35:02.800
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

35:02.940 --> 35:09.870
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

35:09.970 --> 35:19.970
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

35:20.310 --> 35:27.510
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

35:26.710 --> 35:28.280
Smells good, Miss.

35:27.530 --> 35:34.700
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

35:28.440 --> 35:29.280
What is this?

35:31.320 --> 35:33.320
Poria and yam strengthen the spleen,

35:33.320 --> 35:36.190
while gorgon nut, lotus seed,
and ginseng nourish the body.

35:34.730 --> 35:38.310
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

35:36.630 --> 35:39.880
It is perfect for those recovering
from severe injuries or illnesses.

35:38.330 --> 35:41.950
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

35:40.510 --> 35:41.440
This product

35:41.960 --> 35:43.190
might also sell very well.

35:41.980 --> 35:48.390
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

35:43.710 --> 35:45.070
My Lady, you're so capable.

35:45.070 --> 35:46.730
Whatever you do will succeed.

35:49.590 --> 35:50.710
Fan Zhong said

35:50.920 --> 35:54.520
Lord Yan would come over after
finishing his government duties.

36:04.620 --> 36:10.540
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

36:11.500 --> 36:17.860
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

36:18.280 --> 36:25.110
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

36:25.440 --> 36:32.350
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

36:32.480 --> 36:39.640
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

36:36.590 --> 36:37.590
My Lady,

36:37.800 --> 36:39.770
it's already the third quarter
of the You hour.

36:39.770 --> 36:49.750
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

36:40.590 --> 36:41.320
Throw this away.

36:41.320 --> 36:42.030
Qingyuan!

36:44.480 --> 36:45.280
Young Master.

36:47.840 --> 36:48.770
Young Master Li.

36:49.760 --> 36:50.360
Are you alright?

36:49.850 --> 36:57.410
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

36:51.800 --> 36:54.260
Thank you for your concern,
Young Master Li.

36:54.630 --> 36:55.630
Glad you're fine.

36:57.430 --> 37:04.740
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

37:00.150 --> 37:01.630
They all said you were in trouble,

37:01.630 --> 37:02.960
but I didn't believe it.

37:02.960 --> 37:04.030
I was about to come looking for you,

37:04.030 --> 37:05.190
but my father locked me up instead.

37:04.760 --> 37:08.120
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

37:05.670 --> 37:06.550
Soon after, I heard

37:06.550 --> 37:07.610
that you were fine.

37:08.110 --> 37:09.110
But I really missed you,

37:08.140 --> 37:11.850
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

37:11.400 --> 37:12.360
so I went on a hunger strike for days

37:11.880 --> 37:18.270
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

37:12.630 --> 37:15.030
before I finally got the chance
to come out.

37:15.150 --> 37:16.150
Sorry to make you worry.

37:16.150 --> 37:16.960
I'm fine.

37:20.880 --> 37:21.680
New pastries?

37:22.550 --> 37:24.480
My Lady made it herself.

37:23.170 --> 37:29.770
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

37:24.800 --> 37:26.280
It's called Ningxin Cake.

37:29.890 --> 37:36.960
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

37:37.020 --> 37:40.370
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

37:38.590 --> 37:39.670
Ningxin Cake?

37:40.400 --> 37:44.020
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

37:42.400 --> 37:44.000
Is it the 'xin' in Li Congxin?

37:44.050 --> 37:50.390
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

37:47.110 --> 37:48.000
Good name.

37:52.670 --> 37:55.510
It means to calm the mind
and soothe the spirit.

37:58.230 --> 37:59.830
It still suits me perfectly.

38:08.110 --> 38:10.710
Miss, you invited me
to taste the new pastries.

38:12.030 --> 38:14.290
Why did you give it to someone else first?

38:14.880 --> 38:17.410
Punctuality is a basic virtue
of a gentleman.

38:17.960 --> 38:19.510
Your Lordship was late yourself.

38:19.510 --> 38:22.070
Won't you let those
who arrived early eat first?

38:22.070 --> 38:24.000
I came out of a pile of dead bodies.

38:24.320 --> 38:26.720
I've never learned any
ways of a gentleman.

38:27.960 --> 38:29.840
Lord Yan, of course you're a gentleman.

38:29.840 --> 38:31.040
Not only a gentleman,

38:31.280 --> 38:33.140
but also a savior to my wife and me.

38:35.710 --> 38:36.970
I'll take a seat first.

38:38.760 --> 38:40.020
If he hadn't saved you,

38:40.070 --> 38:42.330
I'd have left for the afterlife with you.

38:44.030 --> 38:45.630
Then you can leave right now.

38:45.840 --> 38:47.570
I'll give you this empty title.

38:48.320 --> 38:50.720
A gentleman doesn't take what others love,

38:51.030 --> 38:51.920
but I

38:52.760 --> 38:55.110
like to take by force.

38:57.920 --> 38:58.590
Qingyuan.

39:00.000 --> 39:01.800
My mother has already prepared
the betrothal gifts for me.

39:01.800 --> 39:03.920
They will be sent to Xie Residence
in a few days.

39:03.920 --> 39:05.550
When the time comes, I hope Lord Yan

39:05.550 --> 39:06.610
will do me the honor

39:06.760 --> 39:08.220
of attending our wedding.

39:21.110 --> 39:22.040
It's so crowded.

39:22.960 --> 39:23.760
Young master.

39:24.070 --> 39:24.960
The Marquis is back.

39:24.960 --> 39:25.960
Let's go quickly.

39:30.960 --> 39:32.920
Wasn't he supposed to
entertain guests tonight?

39:32.920 --> 39:34.380
Why did he come back early?

39:34.480 --> 39:36.030
If you don't want to go back, that's fine.

39:36.030 --> 39:38.150
I'll just get beaten again.

39:38.550 --> 39:39.550
It's all up to you.

39:41.760 --> 39:42.360
Qingyuan.

39:43.230 --> 39:44.070
I have something to do today,

39:44.070 --> 39:45.200
so I'll leave first.

39:46.320 --> 39:47.190
The Ningxin Cake is delicious,

39:47.190 --> 39:48.790
and I like the name very much.

39:50.760 --> 39:52.360
I'll come again another day.

39:52.920 --> 39:54.030
I will return the plate.

39:54.030 --> 39:54.840
Keep it.

39:57.760 --> 39:58.360
Childish.

39:58.440 --> 39:59.070
Exactly.

39:59.480 --> 40:00.740
I'm talking about you.

40:06.320 --> 40:07.980
What a heartless shopkeeper.

40:10.920 --> 40:12.840
I was late because I was queuing

40:12.840 --> 40:14.300
for this osmanthus candy.

40:17.030 --> 40:18.800
Not only did I get nothing in return,

40:18.800 --> 40:20.800
but someone else reaped the benefits.

40:20.800 --> 40:22.530
He even stole my Ningxin Cakes.

40:23.760 --> 40:25.360
Then tell me, Your Lordship,

40:25.510 --> 40:27.240
what kind of return do you want?

40:28.230 --> 40:29.510
It's almost closing time.

40:29.510 --> 40:31.110
Accompany me for a stroll.

40:37.960 --> 40:39.690
How is Your Lordship's injury?

40:40.280 --> 40:41.630
Without you by my side,

40:41.630 --> 40:43.230
it's taking its time to heal.

40:43.510 --> 40:45.760
Lately, the wound
has been aching slightly.

40:45.760 --> 40:46.760
My chest

40:47.230 --> 40:48.880
even bled a little today.

40:49.150 --> 40:50.110
Why is it so serious?

40:50.110 --> 40:50.760
Let me see.

40:51.360 --> 40:52.230
Now?

40:53.590 --> 40:54.800
All right, come on.

40:55.630 --> 40:56.150
Yan Rui!

41:00.710 --> 41:02.440
Since you care so much about me,

41:02.480 --> 41:04.550
I will cherish my life in the future

41:06.800 --> 41:08.130
so as not to let you down.

41:14.920 --> 41:16.590
You are so shameless.

41:17.000 --> 41:18.000
You got hurt because of me.

41:18.000 --> 41:19.060
That's why I asked.

41:19.320 --> 41:20.880
Even if you fatally injure
yourself in the future,

41:20.880 --> 41:21.610
I won't care.

41:22.070 --> 41:22.760
Of course.

41:23.110 --> 41:25.400
You're engaged now.

41:25.590 --> 41:27.550
Naturally, you can't be entangled
with a notorious

41:27.550 --> 41:28.610
corrupt official.

41:29.110 --> 41:30.030
In the future,

41:30.110 --> 41:32.070
even if I go through hell for you,

41:32.090 --> 41:33.620
you won't feel sorry for me.

41:34.110 --> 41:35.770
Do you have to speak like this?

41:35.920 --> 41:36.840
Not necessarily.

41:36.840 --> 41:38.100
I won't say it anymore.

41:52.070 --> 41:53.030
Tell me,

41:55.070 --> 41:56.440
after Yan and Yunya

41:56.760 --> 41:58.090
leave Anxiang Village,

41:59.070 --> 42:01.280
what kind of story will they experience?

42:01.280 --> 42:04.070
Yan would bask in the sun

42:04.070 --> 42:05.200
and drink every day.

42:05.630 --> 42:06.400
As for Yunya,

42:06.840 --> 42:08.800
in these spring-like days,

42:09.320 --> 42:12.110
she can finally get rid of
the burdens on her shoulders

42:12.110 --> 42:14.710
and live the way she wants.

42:19.550 --> 42:20.150
Let's go.

42:20.150 --> 42:21.550
I'll take you somewhere.

